{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"user","type":"text","text":"**User / Client**\n\n输入 `prompt/chatId/userId`\n请求 AI 能力","x":-420,"y":320,"width":240,"height":130,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"program_controller","type":"text","text":"**ProgramController**\n\n`/program/chat`\n`/program/rag`\n`/program/chat/mcp`","x":-120,"y":160,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"simple_controller","type":"text","text":"**SimpleChatController**\n\n`/simple/chat`\n`/simple/chat/mcp`","x":-120,"y":420,"width":280,"height":140,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"orchestrator","type":"text","text":"**AiConversationOrchestratorService.orchestrate(...)**\n\n统一编排入口\n- 先做意图路由\n- 再做链路分流\n- 统一状态回写","x":220,"y":290,"width":360,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"intent_router","type":"text","text":"**IntentRouterService.route(prompt)**\n\n输出：\n`intent/channelIntent/orderIntent/ticketIntent`\n+ confidence","x":660,"y":80,"width":330,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"command_path","type":"text","text":"**COMMAND 短路**\n\n`CommandOperationService.handleCommand(...)`\n- 查看摘要\n- 清空摘要(二次确认)\n- 清空会话(二次确认)","x":1090,"y":-10,"width":350,"height":190,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"program_scope_decision","type":"text","text":"**isProgramScope?**\n`ASSISTANT / MARKDOWN / ANALYSIS`","x":660,"y":340,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"program_disambiguation","type":"text","text":"**冲突意图澄清**\n\n多意图同时高置信时\n返回澄清文案，不执行链路","x":1090,"y":240,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"program_order","type":"text","text":"**Program ORDER 链路**\n\n`runOrderFlow(...)`\n-> `OrderPlanExecuteService.handle(...)`","x":1090,"y":430,"width":330,"height":150,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"program_ops","type":"text","text":"**Program OPS 链路**\n\n`runOpsFlow(...)`\n-> `OpsReactService.runReactCycle(analysisChatClient, ...)`","x":1090,"y":620,"width":350,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"program_rag","type":"text","text":"**Program RAG 链路**\n\n`runRagFlow(...)`\n-> `buildGeneralStream(markdownChatClient, ...)`","x":1090,"y":820,"width":350,"height":150,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"program_general","type":"text","text":"**Program 默认链路**\n\n`buildGeneralStream(assistantChatClient, ...)`","x":1090,"y":1010,"width":320,"height":130,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"simple_scene_router","type":"text","text":"**Simple 二级路由**\n\n`SceneRouterService.route(...)`\n-> `ORDER / OPS / GENERAL`","x":660,"y":560,"width":320,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"simple_order","type":"text","text":"**Simple ORDER**\n\n`OrderPlanExecuteService.handle(...)`","x":1090,"y":1210,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"simple_ops","type":"text","text":"**Simple OPS**\n\n`OpsReactService.runReactCycle(chatClient, ..., extraToolCallbacks)`","x":1090,"y":1380,"width":360,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"simple_general","type":"text","text":"**Simple GENERAL**\n\n`buildGeneralStream(chatClient, ...)`","x":1090,"y":1560,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"order_state_machine","type":"text","text":"**OrderPlanExecute 状态机**\n\n`INIT -> CHECK -> LOCK -> PAY -> CONFIRM -> DONE`\nPAY 阶段需“确认下单”","x":1540,"y":430,"width":340,"height":180,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"order_concrete_calls","type":"text","text":"**下单具体调用**\n\n`AiProgram.selectTicketCategory(...)`\n`AiProgram.createOrder(...)`\n-> ProgramCall/UserCall/TicketCategoryCall/OrderCall","x":1540,"y":660,"width":360,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ops_react_calls","type":"text","text":"**OPS 具体调用（ReAct）**\n\n`Thought -> Action -> Observation`\n通过 MCP ToolCallbacks 查日志/指标/链路\n高危动作仅门禁提示","x":1540,"y":930,"width":360,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"rag_concrete_calls","type":"text","text":"**RAG 具体调用**\n\n`markdownChatClient`\n+ `QuestionAnswerAdvisor(vectorStore)`\n+ QueryRewrite(可选)","x":1540,"y":1160,"width":340,"height":170,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"general_stream_calls","type":"text","text":"**通用调用模板**\n\n`chatClient.prompt().system().user().advisors()`\n可选 `toolCallbacks(extraToolCallbacks)`\n`requestSpec.stream().content()`","x":1540,"y":1380,"width":370,"height":190,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"chatclient_defaults","type":"text","text":"**ChatClient 默认能力**\n\nassistant: `defaultTools(aiProgram)`\nanalysis: `defaultToolCallbacks(mcp)`\nmarkdown: RAG advisors","x":1990,"y":1110,"width":320,"height":170,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"response_stateback","type":"text","text":"**统一回写与返回**\n\n`ConversationStateService`\n- onChatCompleted/onChatError\n最终返回 Flux<String>","x":1990,"y":1380,"width":320,"height":160,"color":"2"}
	],
